        "Different geometric shapes and sizes of the pieces do not affect the count argument.",
        "No discard, gluing or other operation is stated. Allowing unmentioned piece removal would change the process, so it is not silently added.",
        "A finite piece-count target is a finite-stage task; no limit operation is needed.",
        "The source asks only the impossibility proof, not a separate classification or construction of all attainable counts."
      ],
      "unresolved_material_ambiguity": null
    },
